{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/48309-on-stockpiles","id":48309,"title":"On Stockpiles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-13T10:46:01-08:00","id":48309,"title":"On Stockpiles","content":"If a generator or other such energy transference device were used as a stockpile, could it be used as an essentially unlimited form of energy, a sort of ersatz perpetual-motion machine?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T14:30:02-08:00","id":51878,"title":"","content":"I had this same thought when I first read about Stockpiles. I would say that since the preview document uses powering a car as an example, and a gasoline or deisel fuel generator is *basically* an engine that you could use it as a stockpile and generate &quot;unlimited&quot; free energy. Of course you would be limited by what the generator could realistically produce at peak efficiency and I would probably rule that you couldn't turn an entire coal power plant into a stockpile for example. If it becomes a problem, if players try to start their own power company or something, investigators both mundane and otherwise will probably get involved. If they just want to have a safehouse or a compound that exists off the grid but they don't want to give up on the luxury of electric lights, air conditioning, food refrigeration, etc. I would allow it with little consequences. Still, having an gas generator running with a bone-dry tank or never using up the fuel it does contain will spark the curiosity of anyone who discovers it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1591-freshman","name":"Freshman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1591_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}